  "body": "# Spunky Boost\n\nDo you face lag or crashes while playing Minecraft on PojavLauncher? Don’t worry! The **Spunky Boost Modpack** is here to fix that. It’s made to make your Minecraft game run faster and smoother, even on slow devices.\n\nThe Spunky Boost Modpack is a group of special mods that help Minecraft run better on PojavLauncher. It’s lightweight, meaning it won’t slow down your device but will make the game run much smoother.\n\n---\n\n## Feature Overview\n\n1. **No More Lag**  \n   It makes the game run faster, so you don’t get stuck or lag during gameplay.\n\n2. **Fixes Crashes**  \n   It helps prevent the game from crashing, giving you a better experience.\n\n3. **Works on Low-End Devices**  \n   Even if your device isn’t powerful, this modpack helps it run Minecraft without issues.\n\n4. **Easy to Use**  \n   You don’t need to be an expert. Just install the modpack, and you’re good to go!\n",
